# kk-daily-publish3-cn-peak — domestic live window (tasks 0323 R5, 0334 R1-R3).
#
# Fires at 17:00 local because the audience window is 09:00 Asia/Shanghai and launchd/cron
# intervals follow the MACHINE's zone; the first node (`publish-matrix-wait-until 09:00
# Asia/Shanghai`) sleeps the remainder, which is 1 h from 17:00 PDT and 0 h after the DST flip —
# so the entry never needs editing twice a year.
#
# `live_channels` is baked in: this installed line IS the operator's ADR-022 consent for a live
# send. Nothing in the workflow or the preset can produce `live` on its own. The window is
# consent-scoped to tokens with a cn-peak row (weibo-pub). Every live launch
# stops at the `send-confirm` gate and waits for the operator's manual resume; the entry never
# delivers unattended.
#
# The launch goes through plugins/kk/scripts/voice3-publish-window.ts (task 0334): a crontab
# command ends at the first UNESCAPED percent sign, so inline `date +%F` shell silently truncates
# the entry — the launcher owns the LA date math, resolves the GENERATION bundle from the
# effective works root (never the publish3 output directory), refuses a missing/mismatched
# bundle, validates the token list against the preset's cn-peak rows, and only then execs spur.
# The rehearsal pins the shipped default preset; change it at cutover.
#
# Rendered by `kk schedule render kk-daily-publish3-cn-peak --platform cron --repo <checkout>`;
# kk never edits the operator's crontab. MERGE, never replace:
#
#     crontab -l > /tmp/kk-cn-peak.cron 2>/dev/null || :
#     kk schedule render kk-daily-publish3-cn-peak --platform cron --repo "$PWD" >> /tmp/kk-cn-peak.cron
#     crontab /tmp/kk-cn-peak.cron
#
# `run_date` is computed at tick time in America/Los_Angeles by the launcher: a run that starts
# at 17:00 PDT is still "today" for the day dir the 04:30 generation wrote.
0 17 * * * cd {{repo}} && mkdir -p .works/kk-daily-publish3 && PATH="{{home}}/.bun/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin" TZ=America/Los_Angeles bun {{repo}}/plugins/kk/scripts/voice3-publish-window.ts --window cn-peak --preset daily-ai-voice --live-channels weibo-pub >> {{repo}}/.works/kk-daily-publish3/cn-peak.log 2>&1
